 NOTE ON USE

 NetSpecter is an offensive security tool. It is published for the purpose of
 authorized penetration testing, security research, and education. The authors
 explicitly CONDEMN unauthorized use of this software against networks and
 devices for which the operator does not have explicit written authorization.

 Use of NetSpecter against systems you do not own or have not been authorized
 to test may violate computer-misuse laws in your jurisdiction (in the Arab
 Republic of Egypt, see Law No. 175 of 2018 on Anti-Cyber and Information
 Technology Crimes; comparable statutes exist in most jurisdictions).